<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Personal journaling is a common self-reflection practice, but its unstructured nature makes it difficult to identify emotional patterns, stress buildup, or long-term trends. As a result, early signs of burnout often go unnoticed, and existing tools using basic sentiment analysis fail to capture emotional complexity over time.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (This project addresses the gap by proposing a privacy-aware NLP-based system that analyzes journal entries to detect emotional patterns and provide meaningful, wellness-focused insights, while ensuring user privacy and avoiding medical diagnosis.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
